        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Silk and cotton sari, pink and black checked field, orange and white horizontal bands at both ends, India, ca. 1855."@en , "Intended for use as garment, clothing."@en , "Silk and cotton sari, complete in length but with some sections removed from the field. Red and black cotton warps with pink silk warps in the side borders. Silk wefts. The field has a small pink and black check pattern; both ends have horizontal bands in orange and white silk. The side borders have chevron patterns in white cotton."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/46ce6cdd-cdb1-3f01-b5f0-ff706d8dd591> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Silk and cotton sari, complete in length but with some sections removed from the field. Red and black cotton warps with pink silk warps in the side borders. Silk wefts. The field has a small pink and black check pattern; both ends have horizontal bands in orange and white silk. The side borders have chevron patterns in white cotton."@en , "Intended for use as garment, clothing."@en , "Silk and cotton sari, pink and black checked field, orange and white horizontal bands at both ends, India, ca. 1855."@en ;
